            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> 64-Bit or 32-Bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 | AMD FX-6100, or better<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> DirectX10 Compatible GPU, NVIDIA GeForce 470 GTX or AMD Radeon 6870 HD series card or higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 10<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 7 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> It is possible to run the game on lower specs than what is noted as minimum, but we do not recommend it. These minimum specs are of really low graphics quality but it does not affect the gameplay, only the graphics.</li></ul>",
